### 3. Breadcrumbs on detail pages

Simple additions — no route changes.

#### `templates/grammar-detail.html` (after line 5, before `<div class="gp-header">`)

```html
<a class="back-link" href="/grammar">&larr; {{ t("nav_grammar") }}</a>
```

#### `templates/vocab-entry.html` (after line 5, before `<div class="word">`)

```html
<a class="back-link" href="/vocab">&larr; {{ t("nav_vocab") }}</a>
```

#### `templates/grammar-chunk.html` (line 15)

Replace `javascript:history.back()` with a proper link. This template is reached from either grammar-detail or lesson-activity-grammar, so `history.back()` is actually fine here. Optionally change to `/grammar` as a safe fallback. **Low priority — leave as-is if desired.**

#### CSS (if `.back-link` isn't already styled)

```css
.back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--c-text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
.back-link:hover { color: var(--c-charcoal); }
```

#### Files changed

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| `templates/grammar-detail.html` | Add back link |
| `templates/vocab-entry.html` | Add back link |
| `static/style.css` | `.back-link` style (if not present) |

